 What is Digital Marketing? A Quick Guide for Beginners

Digital Marketing is a fast-growing field that involves promoting products and services using digital channels like Google, social media, websites, and email.

Today, every business, small or big, needs digital marketing strategies to reach their target audience online.

Key Components of Digital Marketing:
✅ Search Engine Optimization (SEO): Improving website ranking on Google search.

✅ Google Ads (PPC): Running paid ads on Google for instant visibility.

✅ Social Media Marketing (SMM): Promoting brands on platforms like Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and Twitter.

✅ Content Marketing: Creating valuable content like blogs, videos, infographics to attract and engage customers.

✅ Email Marketing: Sending promotional emails to potential customers.

✅ Affiliate Marketing: Earning commission by promoting other companies' products online.

✅ Web Analytics: Tracking and analyzing user behavior on websites to improve performance.

